# Everything is excluded by default; only the entries re-included below ship.
**

# Shipped files. Adding a new runtime asset (icon, walkthrough image,
# extra bundle chunk)? Re-include it here or it will NOT be packaged.
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE.txt
!dist/extension.js

# Never ship secrets, even if a rule above is loosened later.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.ovsx-token
.vsce-token
*.vsix
